# Upload only what the site serves: web/ (the ghost screen at the root, Daylight, its fonts, the
# demo save), the browser code the ghost screen imports (runner/, agent/, verify/, without their
# tests), the game with the engine and text it imports, and the narration function: api/, its
# cache, and package.json for its one dependency. Everything else (vendor's docs and
# sheet, scripts, reports, tests) stays off the site, so a path like
# /vendor/dry-run-engine/SIMULATION-MATHS.md is a 404.
/*
!/vercel.json
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json
!/api
!/cache
!/web
/web/test
!/runner
/runner/test
!/agent
/agent/test
!/verify
/verify/test
!/vendor
/vendor/*
!/vendor/dry-run-engine
/vendor/dry-run-engine/*
!/vendor/dry-run-engine/game
!/vendor/dry-run-engine/engine
!/vendor/dry-run-engine/text
